      Full model-based evaluation requires:
        1. Load entry_enter/entry_cancel models
        2. Extract features per bar
        3. Run agent.decide() on each bar


Expected improvements from Entry Agent:
  • Fewer trades (waits for optimal entry)
  • Higher win rate (avoids entering at highs)
  • Better PnL (larger initial buffer)
  • Reduced SL hits (better timing)



